{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594680/extras/1662f0d7057beace1880f9d296ea3438.poster.avif?t=1767710338\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594680/extras/1662f0d7057beace1880f9d296ea3438.webm?t=1767710338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594680/extras/1662f0d7057beace1880f9d296ea3438.mp4?t=1767710338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play rounds where you\u2019re either delivering food or stopping the other team from doing it. Swap roles every round\u2014turn up the heat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594680/extras/1a20d7effa774141db2b8d73bee60f51.poster.avif?t=1767710338\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594680/extras/1a20d7effa774141db2b8d73bee60f51.webm?t=1767710338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594680/extras/1a20d7effa774141db2b8d73bee60f51.mp4?t=1767710338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo against bots, team up in co-op, or battle online with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594680/extras/1c935f77e8e40540dc32ac25b6c91921.poster.avif?t=1767710338\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594680/extras/1c935f77e8e40540dc32ac25b6c91921.webm?t=1767710338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594680/extras/1c935f77e8e40540dc32ac25b6c91921.mp4?t=1767710338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One round you're a guard, the next a thief. Each battle flips your role and assigns you a random food fighter. Stay sharp\u2014adapt fast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594680/extras/4f57abacb44a9f976d9f20c888eaa3bf.poster.avif?t=1767710338\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594680/extras/4f57abacb44a9f976d9f20c888eaa3bf.webm?t=1767710338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594680/extras/4f57abacb44a9f976d9f20c888eaa3bf.mp4?t=1767710338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chaotic mix of wild weapons, fast-paced rounds, and unpredictable food-fueled battles. Add it to your wishlist and join the fight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3594680?t=1767710338","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3594680?t=1767710338","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594680/af400a12f6c4c61de454fdee6aca5c55e2b26464/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767710338","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594680/af400a12f6c4c61de454fdee6aca5c55e2b26464/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767710338","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description"